          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo cwo ario jowire wok kenyo, aka jokidho yu Sodom; to Abraham medere cungo ruwaŋ Rwoth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Abraham ocore cegin to penjo Rwoth ni, “Inorey adieri jom'otire kanyacel gi jokidakana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'obedi ji piero abic ma jotire i tindi madwoŋ, inorey tindi madwoŋ gibe? Ik'owey tindi madwoŋ ro ji piero abic ma jotire ma jonitie i iye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wobedi bor kodin timo nger gino, neko jom'otire kanyacel gi jokidakana, aka jom'otire jolimi gir'acula kanyacel gi jokidakana! Gino wobedi bor kodin! Jathum banja ma piny gibe k'otimi gim'otire!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
