              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth waco ni, “K'anonwaŋ ji piero abic ma jotire i Sodom, akibino reyo woko tindi madwoŋ gibe ro jo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.26",
