          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To poyo kwoŋ ji piero abic ma jotire no, orem ji abic, inorey woko tindi madwoŋ gibe ro ji abic ma jongoye no?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.28",
